  "job_C16.1_20251003_115213": {
    "chunk_text": "edere, lites cum importunis significat wex drige etan saca mid ungecoplicum getacna\u00fe. Columbas uiderit aliquam tristitiam significat culfran gesih\u00f0 sume unrotnysse getacna\u00fe. Carcere qui se uiderit, aliquam sollicitudinem uel calumpniam significat on cwearterne se\u00fee hine gesih\u00f0 Caput album habere, lucrum significat heafod wit habban gestreon getacna\u00fe. Caput sibi tondi, dampnum significat heafod him beon gescoren hearm getacna\u00fe. Calciamento nouo calciari, lucrum ex insperato significat mid gescy niwum beon gescod gestreon of Calciamento ueteri calciari, deceptionem significat mid gescy ealdum beon gescod swicunge getacna\u00fe. Clauos colligere uel facere, laborem significat spicyngas gadirian o\u00f0\u00f0e wyrcean geswinc hit getacna\u00f0. Canes latrantes uiderit, uel eis infestare, inimici tui te superare querunt significat hundas beorcynde Canes ludere uiderit, gratiam significat hundas plegan gesih\u00f0 \u00feanc hit getacna\u00f0. Caput lauare, ab omni metu & omni periculo liberabitur heafod \u00fewean fram \u00e6lcum ege & \u00e6lcere Caseum recentem accipere, lucrum significat cyse geongne onfon gestreon getacna\u00fe. Salsum si fuerit, litem significat sealt gif he bi\u00f0 sace hit getacna\u00f0. Camelos uidere & ab eis se uiderit infestare, litem significat olfendas geseon & fram him gesih\u00f0 Carbones qui se uiderit edere, inimici tui de te mala loquuntur gleda se\u00fee hine gesih\u00f0 etan fynd \u00feine be Cancellos uider",
